== Administrative divisions ==
[[File:Anakapalli.png|alt=Anakapalli District|thumb|Satellite view of Anakapalli district]]

The district is divided into 3 revenue divisions: [[Anakapalli revenue division|Anakapalli]], [[Adduroad Junction revenue division|Adduroad Junction]] and [[Narsipatnam revenue division|Narsipatnam]], which are further subdivided into 24 [[Tehsil|mandal]]s, each headed by a sub-collector.<ref name=newdiv>{{cite news|title=GO issued for creation of Anakapalle revenue division|url=https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Visakhapatnam/go-issued-for-creation-of-anakapalle-revenue-division/article4580216.ece|access-date=21 November 2015|work=The Hindu|date=4 April 2013|location=Viskhapatnam}}</ref>{{Obsolete source|Districts have been reorganised, can't use this as a reference for the current structure. Still useful for discussing the historical district structure, so shouldn't be deleted outright.|date=November 2026}}

