=== Cities and towns ===
The district consists of two municipalities and 8 census towns. Anakapalli falls under [[Greater Visakhapatnam Municipal Corporation]] and the two municipalities in the district are [[Elamanchili]] and [[Narsipatnam]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Adminsistrative divisions of Visakhapatnam district|url=http://visakhapatnam.nic.in/at-a-glance.html|website=Visakhapatnam District|publisher=National Informatics Centre|url-status=dead|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190701203053/http://visakhapatnam.nic.in/at-a-glance.html|archive-date=2019-07-01|access-date=2026-11-11}}</ref>{{Obsolete source|Outdated for discussing Anakapalli district (it's for Vizag), but still useful for historical information. The data seems to be pulled from the 2011 census.|date=November 2026}} The census towns are [[Bowluvada]], [[Chodavaram, Visakhapatnam district|Chodavaram]], [[Kantabamsuguda]], [[Mulakuddu]], [[Nakkapalle]], [[Narsipatnam]], [[Peda Boddepalle]], [[Payakaraopeta]].{{citation needed|date= September 2022}}

